    <property title="Name">Hydrogen carbonate</property>
    <property title="Description">Hydrogen carbonate (bicarbonate), HCO3-, is the amphiprotic conjugate base of carbonic acid and conjugate acid of carbonate. In water it participates in acid-base equilibria that buffer pH in natural waters, blood plasma, and industrial carbonate systems.</property>
